OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FRenowned British-Nepali climber Nirmal
OL,8,FPurja and nine other climbers swept
OL,9,Faway by an avalanche in Pakistan are
OL,10,Fconfirmed to have died, and search
OL,11,Fteams were trying to recover their
OL,12,Fbodies, Purja's expedition company
OL,13,Fsaid on Saturday.
OL,15,F"The world has lost one of
OL,16,Fmountaineering's greatest climbers,"
OL,17,Fthe company, Elite Exped, said in a
OL,18,Fstatement, adding that all the lives
OL,19,Flost were being mourned. "No words can
OL,20,Fease the pain of this unimaginable
OL,21,Floss."
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@dO]{D@ZOU}D@FO]
