PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FThe 10-member expedition was swept
OL,8,Faway by an avalanche on Thursday on
OL,9,FPakistan's Broad Peak.
OL,11,FRescuers found four bodies and
OL,12,Frecovered three of them on Friday in
OL,13,Fharsh weather that hampered flights by
OL,14,Fsearch and rescue helicopters.
OL,15,FRescuers backed by military
OL,16,Fhelicopters had resumed a search
OL,17,Fearlier on Saturday for the others.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,F"The loss of these courageous
OL,8,Fclimbers, who came from different
OL,9,Fnations united by their passion for
OL,10,Fthe mountains, is an immeasurable loss
OL,11,Fto the global mountaineering
OL,12,Ffraternity," said Irfan Arshad Khan,
OL,13,Fthe president of the Alpine Club of
OL,14,FPakistan.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
