OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FKhan paid tribute to the military and
OL,8,Fcivilian rescuers and sherpas who took
OL,9,Fpart in the search mission. "The
OL,10,Fmountains inspire us with their
OL,11,Fbeauty, but they also remind us of the
OL,12,Fimmense risks faced by those who
OL,13,Fventure into the high Himalaya and
OL,14,FKarakoram," he said.
OL,26,@qD@]OUvD@KO]
