PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FEarlier on Saturday, a local police
OL,8,Fofficial, Tahir Khan, said the remains
OL,9,Fof Omani climber Nathira Ahmed were
OL,10,Fbeing flown to the capital, Islamabad,
OL,11,Fwhile the bodies of American climber
OL,12,FMallory Geis and Nepalese climber
OL,13,FBahadur Gurung remained at a hospital
OL,14,Fin Skardu, the main city in Pakistan's
OL,15,Fnorthern Gilgit-Baltistan region.
OL,17,FChina's embassy in Pakistan said a
OL,18,FChinese mountaineer also was among the
OL,19,Fmissing after the avalanche, Xinhua
OL,20,FNews Agency reported Sunday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
