OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe expedition was led by Purja, the
OL,13,FNepal-born former British Army soldier
OL,14,Fwidely known as Nims Dai. He climbed
OL,15,Fthe world's 14 highest peaks in a
OL,16,Frecord 189 days in 2019, an
OL,17,Fachievement featured in the Netflix
OL,18,Fdocumentary "14 Peaks: Nothing Is
OL,19,FImpossible." His record was broken in
OL,20,F2023.
OL,26,@zD@MOU{D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
