SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FPurja's company described him as "a
OL,8,Fleader who inspired millions through
OL,9,Fhis courage, humility and unwavering
OL,10,Fbelief that human potential is far
OL,11,Fgreater than we often imagine."
OL,13,FA statement from Geis' family said
OL,14,F"Mallory was a bright light who was
OL,15,Floved deeply by her family and
OL,16,Ffriends. She will be profoundly
OL,17,Fmissed."
OL,26,@oD@bOUsD@_O]vD@AOUyD@HO]
