PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FThe expedition was Geis' first try at
OL,8,Fan 8,000-meter peak in Pakistan, while
OL,9,Fit was expected to be the final one
OL,10,Ffor Sakhi, who was a guide for Moving
OL,11,FMountains, a travel company based in
OL,12,FPakistan. Sakhi was also a geographer
OL,13,Fand high-altitude photographer who has
OL,14,Fclimbed some of the world's major
OL,15,Fpeaks, according to the Moving
OL,16,FMountains website.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
