OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785745098
OL,3,CAll 10 climbers swept away in
OL,4,Cavalanche in Pakistan are confirmed
OL,5,Cdead
OL,7,FAccidents are common on climbing
OL,8,Fexpeditions in northern Pakistan
OL,9,Fbecause of avalanches, falling ice and
OL,10,Frock, high altitude and rapidly
OL,11,Fchanging weather.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
